#==============================================================================================
#
#   parsed_cookie - HTTP::Cookie::parse_cookie: a Set-Cookie string as a cookie's attributes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibHTTP/Cookie/ParsedCookie.cpp (lines 28-476: parse_cookie, the
#       attribute steps and parse_date_time) with ParsedCookie.h's MAXIMUM_COOKIE_AGE, and the
#       two helpers of Cookie.cpp it calls (same_site_from_string, default_path). Storing the
#       cookies is the embedder's (LibWebView's CookieJar, through PageClient's
#       page_did_set_cookie).
